    input: A `Tensor`. Rank `r+1`, where `r >= 1`.
    diagonal: A `Tensor`. Must have the same type as `input`.
      Rank `r` when `k` is an integer or `k[0] == k[1]`. Otherwise, it has rank `r+1`.
